WEBVTT

00:00:58.639 --> 00:01:00.976
played as safely
and as quietly as possible.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.652
And seeing as how I had
accidentally broken Amy's arm

00:01:04.676 --> 00:01:05.976
just one week before --

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.937
(Laughter)

00:01:10.099 --> 00:01:11.100
(Laughter ends)

00:01:11.124 --> 00:01:15.784
heroically pushing her out of the way
of an oncoming imaginary sniper bullet,

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.842
(Laughter)

00:01:17.866 --> 00:01:21.949
for which I have yet to be thanked,
I was trying as hard as I could --

00:01:21.973 --> 00:01:23.569
she didn't even see it coming --

00:01:23.593 --> 00:01:25.934
I was trying hard
to be on my best behavior.

00:01:25.958 --> 00:01:27.308
And I saw my sister's face,

00:01:27.332 --> 00:01:29.568
this wail of pain
and suffering and surprise

00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:32.276
threatening to erupt from her mouth
and wake my parents